    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m just running on a treadmill that’s getting faster and faster but i’m not actually going anywhere. like every single cent i make just goes straight to someone else. rent, interest, utilities... it’s like i'm paying a subscription fee just to exist and i can't even afford the premium version of being a person anymore. it just doesn't add up. the math of my life is just... it's all negative.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
